<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>moody</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Royel Otis</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">moody</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">7MerIDn7wpEH4OEGbpasSH</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:00.740" end="00:03.060" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(One, two)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:03.060" end="00:05.870">I've got good intentions</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:05.870" end="00:09.100">She don't see them at all</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:09.100" end="00:11.450">She doesn't mention</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.450" end="00:14.320">That I miss her call</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.320" end="00:16.990">I'm in the dog house again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.990" end="00:24.530">Staring at the wall, wall, wall</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.530" end="00:27.610">She's always giving it to me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.610" end="00:30.180">Right now she's always accusing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.180" end="00:33.160">Last time, she said she would kill me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.160" end="00:36.340">My girl's a bitch when she's moody</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.340" end="00:39.560">But she's my everything</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.560" end="00:42.110">She's all that I need</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.110" end="00:48.090">Sometimes more than I want, want, want</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.090" end="00:56.090" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.640" end="01:02.100">Questions are loaded</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.100" end="01:04.960">Her face says a lot</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.960" end="01:07.690">She's cripticly coded</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.690" end="01:10.610">She's home when I'm not</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.610" end="01:13.470">It's just big emotions</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.470" end="01:16.220">It's not jealousy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.220" end="01:20.640">Most days of the week</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.640" end="01:23.780">She's always giving it to me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.780" end="01:26.340">Late nights, she always accusing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.340" end="01:29.480">Last time, she said she would kill me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.480" end="01:32.640">My girl’s a bitch when she’s moody</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.640" end="01:35.590">But she’s my everything</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.590" end="01:38.110">She’s all that I need</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.110" end="01:45.920">Sometimes more than I want, want, want</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.920" end="01:51.480">Making her eyes rolls</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.480" end="01:57.030">On her bad side, so</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.030" end="02:02.430">Being alone at home</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.430" end="02:03.930">But I can’t let it go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.710" end="02:05.610">No, I can’t let it go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.610" end="02:08.650">She’s always giving it to me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.650" end="02:11.190">Late nights, she always accusing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.190" end="02:14.210">Last time, she said she would kill me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.210" end="02:16.990">My girl’s a bitch when she’s</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.990" end="02:19.880">She’s always giving it to me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.880" end="02:22.380">Late nights, she always accusing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.380" end="02:25.320">Last time, she said she would kill me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:25.320" end="02:28.840">My girl’s a bitch when she’s moody</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:28.840" end="02:31.810">But she’s my everything</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:31.810" end="02:34.370">She’s all that I need</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:34.370" end="02:40.170">Sometimes more than I want, want, want</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:40.170" end="02:44.170" /></div></body></tt>